Build a source-selected Java command-line and bootstrap tool image.

The explicit --enable-build-tools-only option omits desktop modules before
Java/native compilation, skips their unused configure dependencies and omits
their bootstrap generators. Normal builds are unchanged. HotSpot remains the
selected upstream VM variant; no tests, cryptography or required APIs are stubbed.

Backport OpenJDK JDK-8243666 so module hashes cover sorted resource names and
contents, preserving valid hashes through deterministic archive normalization.
Upstream: https://github.com/openjdk/jdk/commit/fe152cdcc5c6ef7e7f3f8c0acf065049e40ee2ea
Author: Alan Bateman; reviewed by Mandy Chung. Includes the upstream regression
test. ModuleHashes.java context is adapted from the older HashMap version;
the upstream implementation and copyright notice are preserved.

